msgstr "La vista en directo terminó."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast: Live view turned itself off after 10 minutes with nobody watching.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Live view turned off: no one watched for 10 minutes."
msgstr "La vista en directo se apagó: nadie miró en 10 minutos."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast as the first computer starts watching the screen (Live view).
