msgstr "No se pudieron leer los enlaces."

#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Saving..."
msgstr "Guardando..."

#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Guardado"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): two fingers swiped
#. to the next page on the last one, with adding a page by swiping turned off.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "This is the last page."
msgstr "Es la última página."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): two fingers swiped
#. to the previous page on the first one.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "This is the first page."
msgstr "Es la primera página."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): Back to the page
#. before was asked with no page to go back to.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Nothing to go back to."
msgstr "No hay a dónde volver."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): two fingers swiped to the
#. next page on the last one now add a page.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Swiping past the last page adds a page."
msgstr "Deslizar tras la última página añade una página."

