#. next page on the last one no longer add a page.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Swiping past the last page adds no page."
msgstr "Deslizar tras la última página no añade página."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): a controller's button
#. changed the eraser to the one named, as Pen feel names it: Whole strokes or Precise.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Eraser: %s"
msgstr "Borrador: %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: the second choice of Pen feel's Eraser row: the eraser takes away only what
#. it touches, as white ink does, keeping the paper's lines (468 px at 44 px).
#: rust/src/editor.rs rust/src/pensettings.rs
msgctxt "eraser"
msgid "Precise"
msgstr "Preciso"

#. TRANSLATORS: the first choice of Pen feel's Eraser row: the eraser takes every stroke it
#. touches away whole (as before 1.1). 468 px at 44 px, or two lines at 34 px.
#: rust/src/editor.rs rust/src/pensettings.rs
msgctxt "eraser"
msgid "Whole strokes"
msgstr "Trazos enteros"

#. TRANSLATORS: in a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): a template picked
#. on the Templates sheet could not become the page's paper (or the new notebook's); %s is
#. the log file that says why.
#: rust/src/editor.rs rust/src/library.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Could not use that template (see %s)."
msgstr "No se pudo usar esa plantilla (detalles en %s)."

#. TRANSLATORS: in a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines): a photo picked on the
#. Photos sheet could not become the page's paper; %s is the log file that says why.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Could not use that photo (see %s)."
msgstr "No se pudo usar esa foto (detalles en %s)."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines), shown once after an update:
#. the editor now shows the whole page when the Kindle is sideways, which two-finger swipes need.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid ""
"Sideways now shows the whole page, so two-finger swipes work. Pinch to zoom "
"in; Display changes this."
msgstr ""
"De lado ahora se ve la página entera y los gestos de dos dedos funcionan. "
"Pellizca para ampliar; se cambia en Pantalla."

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines), shown once: two
#. fingers dragged the zoomed page, where two fingers up and down would open Links and Pages.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Here two fingers move the page. Zoom out for page and link swipes."
msgstr ""
"Aquí dos dedos mueven la página. Aleja para deslizar entre páginas y enlaces."

#. TRANSLATORS: a one-time toast after a finger drawing does not match any recorded shape;
#. about 1700 px at 44 px bold or two lines. Settings > Gestures lists the recorded shapes.
#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "That is not one of your finger shapes. Settings > Gestures lists them."
msgstr "No es una de tus figuras. Ajustes > Gestos las muestra."

#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid ""
"Shape made. Undo takes it away; the toolbar's Shapes menu has the options."
msgstr ""
"Forma hecha. Deshacer la quita; el menú de formas de la barra de "
"herramientas tiene las opciones."

#: rust/src/editor.rs
msgid "Could not read the notebooks."
msgstr "No se pudieron leer los cuadernos."

