#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid ""
"Point at the picture and click Firefox's Picture-in-Picture button, or right-"
"click it and choose Picture-in-Picture."
msgstr ""
"Señala la imagen y pulsa el botón Picture-in-Picture de Firefox, o haz clic "
"derecho sobre ella y elige Picture-in-Picture."

#. TRANSLATORS: Live view's help in the browser on how to get the sharpest picture in picture,
#. which browsers give only to pages they treat as secure (the Kindle's page is plain HTTP).
#. %s is this page's address. about:config, dom.securecontext.allowlist, chrome://flags,
#. edge://flags, brave://flags and "Insecure origins treated as secure" are the browsers' own
#. names: keep them as they are.
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid ""
"For the sharpest picture in picture, let your browser treat this address as "
"secure:"
msgstr ""
"Para la imagen en imagen más nítida, haz que tu navegador trate esta "
"dirección como segura:"

#: rust/src/httpd.rs
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Firefox: open about:config, add %s to dom.securecontext.allowlist (separate "
"several with commas), then reload this page."
msgstr ""
"Firefox: abre about:config, añade %s a dom.securecontext.allowlist (separa "
"varias con comas) y vuelve a cargar esta página."

#: rust/src/httpd.rs
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Chrome, Edge, Brave or Arc: open chrome://flags (edge://flags, brave://"
"flags), find \"Insecure origins treated as secure\", add %s, enable it and "
"relaunch the browser."
msgstr ""
"Chrome, Edge, Brave o Arc: abre chrome://flags (edge://flags, brave://"
"flags), busca \"Insecure origins treated as secure\", añade %s, actívalo y "
"reinicia el navegador."

#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid ""
"Safari floats a video of the page instead, which works on this address as it "
"is."
msgstr ""
"Safari hace flotar un vídeo de la página, que funciona con esta dirección "
"tal como está."

#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "This browser cannot show Live view."
msgstr "Este navegador no puede mostrar la vista en directo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Live view's page while it is off on the Kindle.
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "Live view is off. On the Kindle, open Share and tap Live view."
msgstr ""
"La vista en directo está apagada. En el Kindle, abre Compartir y toca Vista "
"en directo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Live view's code form in the browser: the six digits the Kindle shows.
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "Type the code shown on the Kindle:"
msgstr "Escribe el código que muestra el Kindle:"

#. TRANSLATORS: the code form's button: start watching the Kindle's screen.
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "Watch"
msgstr "Mirar"

#. TRANSLATORS: the code form after a wrong code, and after five (the Kindle shows a new one).
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "That code is not the one on the Kindle."
msgstr "Ese código no es el del Kindle."

#: rust/src/httpd.rs
msgid "Too many tries. Wait 30 seconds, then type the new code."
msgstr "Demasiados intentos. Espera 30 segundos y escribe el código nuevo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Live view's answer to a third computer (two can watch at once).
#: rust/src/httpd.rs
